{"ticker":"SYY","updated":"2026-10-24T00:15:02Z","profile":{"longName":"Sysco Corporation","shortName":"Sysco Corporation","sector":"Consumer Defensive","industry":"Food Distribution","country":"United States","website":"https://www.sysco.com","fullTimeEmployees":75000,"marketCap":40027037696,"trailingPE":21.698668,"forwardPE":15.219758,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":0.47339582,"pegRatio":1.17,"targetMeanPrice":91.08333,"targetHighPrice":100.0,"targetLowPrice":78.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":12,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.047,"earningsGrowth":0.053,"grossMargins":0.18496001,"operatingMargins":0.048449997,"profitMargins":0.02078,"totalRevenue":84552998912,"beta":0.64,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":91.85,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":68.19,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":2.62},"summary":"Sysco Corporation, through its subsidiaries, engages in the sale, marketing, and distribution of food and related products to restaurants, healthcare and educational facilities, lodging establishments, and other foodservice customers. It operates through U.S. Foodservice Operations, International Foodservice Operations, SYGMA, and Other segments. The company distributes frozen food, such as meats, seafood, fully prepared entrées, fruits, vegetables, and desserts; canned and dry food; fresh meats and seafood; dairy and beverage products; imported specialties; and fresh produce. It also supplies paper products, including disposable napkins, plates, and cups; tableware comprising glassware and silverware; cookware consisting of pots, pans, and utensils; restaurant and kitchen equipment and supplies; and cleaning supplies. The company operates in the United States, Canada, the United Kingdom, France, Sweden, and internationally. Sysco Corporation was incorporated in 1969 and is headquartered in Houston, Texas.","summary_zh":"Sysco Corporation 透過其子公司從事向餐廳、醫療保健和教育機構、住宿機構以及其他餐飲服務客戶銷售、行銷和分銷食品及相關產品的業務。它透過美國餐飲服務營運部門、國際餐飲服務營運部門、SYGMA 和其他部門進行營運。該公司分銷冷凍食品，如肉類、海鮮、預製主菜、水果、蔬菜和甜點；罐頭食品和乾食品；新鮮肉類和海鮮；乳製品和飲料產品；進口特產；和新鮮農產品。它還供應紙製品，包括一次性餐巾、盤子和杯子；餐具，包括玻璃器皿和銀器；炊具，包括鍋、平底鍋和器皿；餐廳和廚房設備及用品；和清潔用品。該公司在美國、加拿大、英國、法國、瑞典和國際上開展業務。 Sysco Corporation 成立於 1969 年，總部位於德克薩斯州休斯頓。","sector_zh":"消費者防禦","industry_zh":"食品配送","candles":[{"t":"2025-08-25","o":80.0,"h":80.21,"l":79.08,"c":79.33,"v":2370000},{"t":"2025-08-26","o":79.2,"h":79.71,"l":79.2,"c":79.63,"v":3970500},{"t":"2025-08-27","o":79.91,"h":80.66,"l":79.8,"c":80.3,"v":3134200},{"t":"2025-08-28","o":80.3,"h":80.47,"l":79.11,"c":79.59,"v":1527000},{"t":"2025-08-29","o":79.77,"h":80.61,"l":79.76,"c":80.47,"v":2139600},{"t":"2025-09-02","o":80.34,"h":81.2,"l":80.33,"c":80.55,"v":1917900},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":80.09,"h":82.4,"l":79.83,"c":81.04,"v":3985400},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":81.53,"h":82.56,"l":81.0,"c":82.51,"v":3068600},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":82.43,"h":83.17,"l":81.56,"c":82.45,"v":2675000},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":82.08,"h":82.2,"l":80.33,"c":81.55,"v":3043600},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":81.2,"h":81.47,"l":80.2,"c":80.85,"v":1451500},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":80.31,"h":80.74,"l":79.78,"c":80.19,"v":2135800},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":80.28,"h":81.34,"l":79.97,"c":81.04,"v":2403100},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":81.13,"h":81.6,"l":80.28,"c":81.29,"v":2415700},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":81.14,"h":81.23,"l":79.86,"c":79.87,"v":2104000},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":79.93,"h":81.65,"l":79.87,"c":81.53,"v":4449200},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":81.8,"h":82.85,"l":81.46,"c":82.46,"v":3524900},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":81.92,"h":82.34,"l":80.95,"c":81.93,"v":3594900},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":82.19,"h":83.24,"l":81.97,"c":82.39,"v":7527000},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":82.25,"h":82.51,"l":81.22,"c":81.37,"v":2391800},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":81.44,"h":82.28,"l":81.21,"c":82.22,"v":2670200},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":82.13,"h":82.57,"l":81.65,"c":81.82,"v":2330100},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":82.15,"h":82.21,"l":80.4,"c":81.12,"v":3910600},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":81.23,"h":82.08,"l":81.02,"c":81.94,"v":3008500},{"t":"2025-09-29","o":81.95,"h":82.23,"l":80.34,"c":81.84,"v":2278700},{"